sequenceDiagram
actor Volunteer
participant Client
participant API as NestJS
participant DB as PostgreSQL
Volunteer->>Client: Select event and role
Client->>API: POST application
API->>API: Authenticate and validate
API->>DB: Check status, capacity, eligibility
DB-->>API: Eligibility result
API->>DB: Persist application
DB-->>API: Saved application
API-->>Client: Application response
Client-->>Volunteer: Display status